{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_1000_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c4a28526d1bc9ffe9871010dc55ba0c40cf5755d7056ba1e54f1660aec225288", "ja": "あのポーズをやるコツは、体をグッとやって\n足をビッと立てて、ミッとお腹に力をいれるんだよ！", "zh": "做那个姿势的诀窍，就是咕地身体使劲、\n咻地把脚伸长、唔地肚子用力喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "a8743e58d23f004733299b60edf5543591fa4bcfb6b82ea89c23347a30ff70bd", "ja": "グッとやって、ビッと立てて、ミッと？\nむ～……。", "zh": "咕地使劲、咻地伸长、唔地？\n呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "8ec0625602c56c75f7a329b473708271b7ef82e85a53997f3b2acace22f23178", "ja": "うんっ、なんとなくわかった！\n歩、教えてくれてありがとうっ！", "zh": "嗯，我好像有点懂了！\n步，谢谢你的教学！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "d0779811314f3bd63738767af138c6c453e1ca1e6f46f1b3ab478768a75ea496", "ja": "今のでわかったのか！？\n……うみみもあゆむも、なんかスゴイぞ。", "zh": "刚才那样就学会了！？\n……海美美跟步都好厉害喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7cc5e3d6d96a1a7e62bc62fa55e8e808e1bcb60e3f51d62f91bf211b1640c4b4", "ja": "何がスゴイんだ？", "zh": "什么很厉害？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "1bbbc2622041d0f9201b168274585bc4cce69169170bb4d56efc3ec5caa157bb", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　今ね、歩にカッコイイ\nダンスのポーズ、教えてもらってたんだよ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n刚才啊，步教了我们一个很帅的舞蹈姿势喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8cff14f5e3e3eb483244ccbd28898c61b650a2e8f12eadee7d95e5a7bca9474e", "ja": "へえ、よかったじゃないか。あとで俺も教えて\nもらおうかな。……この書類整理が終わったら。", "zh": "哦～那挺好的啊，晚点也教教我吧。\n……等我整理完这份文件。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "e7fc143650dafff8f7b276056aa1e892c34fc06c5efccb30a7b51895011d186b", "ja": "おやぶん、紙いっぱい持ってるね～。\n今から、それの片付けするの？", "zh": "老大，你拿着好多纸喔～\n现在是要收拾那些吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6ea5848a87e8b85f58f0938a963aeafe2abbd1e98ea340695d6d812df0730dfa", "ja": "そう、いろいろ記入して社長に提出しないと\nいけないんだ。これは今度の公演の資料で……。", "zh": "对啊，我得把文件填好交给社长才行。\n这些是这次公演的资料……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "eeb02f9926acd5f9145c6a1d3f1d70faa04d8247cb4671aad9679e224cabacd5", "ja": "今度の公演っ！？　はい、はーいっ！　私、出たい、\nその公演！　そこでさっきのポーズ、試してみたいな！", "zh": "这次公演！？我要、我要──！我想参加这场公演！\n我想上台试试刚才的姿势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "c137a9d9c980904cd1f05f05c05338e0e0942c56edce3e49f5a0954148e5cf0a", "ja": "あと私、できたらセンターやりたい！！\nううん、できなくてもやりたい！　やりたーいっ！！", "zh": "还有，可以的话我想当Center！！\n啊不，就算不行我也想参加！想参加──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_1011_p", "source_sha256": "85bfd9049c27802a56bb602b121aa1338620e4eeed8aec7f5eaa9142b8282c66", "ja": "おお、すごいやる気だな……。", "zh": "喔喔，你还真有干劲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_1012", "source_sha256": "e270ec23d5b6ff96972f8f7ce419fa9a68cfadaff85b8bd73e39c0e874c4c578", "ja": "よし！", "zh": "好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_2000_p", "source_sha256": "755f3d53ab21282c419ef641181e70b0d9edcd74d34dab7a3bd2f3d5221c53d5", "ja": "よし、今回のセンターは海美でいこう！", "zh": "好，这次的Center就是海美了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_2001_029umi", "source_sha256": "3e32bfe3fb75e346b75593f5321ad6ab9188101fadc85d6cb529f3e3e33efd7d", "ja": "え、ホントにいいの？　わあ、言ってみて良かった～！\nありがとう、{$P$}！", "zh": "咦，真的可以吗？哇啊，有争取看看真是太好了～！\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_2002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "76f5e3c959533d91fecd3eecde179c3d285ec22e939d60449d4214de9878abda", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと～！　そういうことだったら、\nアタシもセンターやりたいんだけど！", "zh": "等、等一下～！这样的话，\n我也想当Center啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_2003_040tam", "source_sha256": "5cdc511884332908907c02a221a9127c6c70c249ef3c793225455214da450d01", "ja": "たまきも出たい～！　たまき、頑張るから、\nセンターにまぜてよ～！", "zh": "环也想参加～！环会加油的，\n也让环当Center吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_2004_029umi", "source_sha256": "ea5c6e8c5ae4fec8d1397d4a35251fb5c9c64dda23267f3aec547fe5790c5aff", "ja": "じゃあ、今回は三人ともセンターってことでもいい？\n{$P$}！？", "zh": "那这次就三个Center可以吗？\n{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_2005", "source_sha256": "0fd7113938e3ddd647c535f09224df214c7cba7c0993ed51b3f25050165c2089", "ja": "無理！", "zh": "没办法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_3000_p", "source_sha256": "b660b02aa87ae535e6c9429fa7fb1ec267086d2b629e0a8f4a8f5601d6043d7a", "ja": "いや、さすがにそれは無理だよ！\nセンターは、あくまで一人じゃないと。", "zh": "不，再怎么说都没办法！\nCenter就是只能一个人而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_3001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "522c6803d07a2894a6e1b07295b5bd65d53b8d676ce03f5044eca8ee9c670a74", "ja": "マイガー！　だったら今回は海美でいいか。\n一番最初に、やりたいって言ったんだし。", "zh": "My God！那这次就给海美吧。\n毕竟是她第一个说想当的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_3002_029umi", "source_sha256": "93f985210718e493232c1e81526e38fc24d5712bdd96d12e771ae7edebdd0d14", "ja": "えへへ、ごめんね、二人ともっ！\n早い者勝ちみたいになっちゃって！", "zh": "嘿嘿，两位抱歉啦！\n结果变成先喊先赢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_3003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a7c8990ab32ba2badfaf34a9b64a4d9b3c97350e6b654d3c139633c8a1b07b05", "ja": "まあ、仕方ないね！　でも、次の公演のセンターは\nアタシが予約だよ、{$P$}。", "zh": "这也没办法嘛！不过，我要先预约\n下次公演的Center喔，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_3004_040tam", "source_sha256": "744765f5e8ac0d06f6a99d68c45c9082d732f5f0829b35f347f71df782b96521", "ja": "じゃあじゃあ、たまきも！　えっとね、たまきはね、\nさっきのポーズが出来るようになったら予約にする！", "zh": "那么那么，环也要！那个啊，环啊，\n学会刚才那个姿势以后就要预约！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_3005_p", "source_sha256": "c61ef1212e8d9120bb7de382cbbf24c8224049466c5fc7b97c8f4a91e69b5d49", "ja": "センターポジションは予約制じゃないんだが……。\nま、まあ、二人の希望は覚えておくよ。", "zh": "Center的位置并不是预约制啊……\n好、好吧，我会记住你们的要求的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_3006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4986c867570e4cf9d67528be942cd57616c65e80df5af23425077608736d5da7", "ja": "よっしゃ！　じゃ、海美、今回は頑張りなよ？\nバックでダンスしてるアタシに負けないようにね！", "zh": "好耶！那么，海美，你这次要加油喔！\n千万别输给在后面伴舞的我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_3007_029umi", "source_sha256": "ab94952c516b5dab251d9023ac5b91f686dc3237b8549b09cd1d51d7184f5a84", "ja": "うんっ！\n歩にガッカリされないように頑張るよ！", "zh": "嗯！\n我会努力不让步失望的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_3008_040tam", "source_sha256": "7762d198dde3eb516e6d4abf0c8a762ab29b73a7bb4b66323da36bea6d4feff2", "ja": "くふふ、今度の公演、楽しくなりそうだぞ～。\nおやぶん！　たまきの出番も作ってねっ！", "zh": "呵呵，这次的公演，感觉会很好玩喔～\n老大！也要给环上台的机会喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_018_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_018_3009_p", "source_sha256": "f5f591ae61c9808a3791078abdfd86b5181854189ba81c67b042d9df69fead5f", "ja": "（海美、歩、環。身体能力が高いアイドル達が中心の\n公演か。面白いステージにできそうだな！）", "zh": "（海美、步、环，以体能优秀的偶像们为主的公演啊。\n感觉会是一场有趣的表演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
